---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ContentProvenance from '../../components/ContentProvenance.astro';
import { ASSEMBLY_DEFAULTS, ASSEMBLY_LIMITS } from '../../lib/assembly-lab';
import '../../styles/assembly-lab.css';
---
<BaseLayout title="有限元装配交互演示" description="用三节点双杆观察局部矩阵如何进入总体矩阵，理解给定位移、奇异刚度与反力恢复。" flush>
  <section class="assembly-hero"><div class="container-wide"><nav class="assembly-breadcrumb" aria-label="面包屑"><a href="/">首页</a><span>/</span><a href="/learning/projects/linear-static/">线性静力项目</a><span>/</span>装配实验室</nav><div class="assembly-hero-grid"><div><span class="assembly-eyebrow">LOCAL → GLOBAL → CONSTRAIN → CHECK</span><h1>让每一项刚度，<br /><em>找到自己的位置。</em></h1><p>从两个杆单元出发，逐项映射、相加，再用原始方程核查位移、反力与能量。</p></div><aside><strong>3 个节点 · 2 个单元 · 1 个方向</strong><p>匿名可查看和操作组装。登录后显式求解小型教学方程；结果来自当前浏览器 JavaScript，非 ANSYS 或在线 CAE 任务。</p><small>原创示意与教学程序 · AI 辅助编写 · 待本人复核</small></aside></div></div></section>
  <div class="container-wide assembly-body" data-assembly-lab>
    <div id="assembly-auth" class="assembly-auth" role="status">正在读取登录状态；矩阵组装可直接查看。</div>
    <section class="assembly-workspace" aria-label="双杆装配实验">
      <div class="assembly-model-panel"><div class="assembly-heading"><div><span class="assembly-eyebrow">01 / FOLLOW THE CONNECTIVITY</span><h2>先选一个单元</h2></div><span class="assembly-tag">示意图，非变形结果</span></div>
        <svg class="assembly-model" viewBox="0 0 480 185" role="img" aria-labelledby="assembly-diagram-title assembly-diagram-desc"><title id="assembly-diagram-title">三节点双杆原创概念图</title><desc id="assembly-diagram-desc">单元一连接节点零和一，单元二连接节点一和二，节点二受向右为正的轴向力。长度不按比例绘制。</desc><g data-fixed-support><path d="M44 53V128m-12-70 12-8m-12 22 12-8m-12 22 12-8m-12 22 12-8m-12 22 12-8" class="assembly-support"/></g><g data-element-shape="0"><rect x="44" y="76" width="185" height="28" rx="2"/><text x="136" y="59" text-anchor="middle">单元 1 · A₁ / L₁</text></g><g data-element-shape="1"><rect x="229" y="76" width="185" height="28" rx="2"/><text x="321" y="59" text-anchor="middle">单元 2 · A₂ / L₂</text></g><g class="assembly-nodes"><circle cx="44" cy="90" r="5"/><circle cx="229" cy="90" r="5"/><circle cx="414" cy="90" r="5"/><text x="44" y="143" text-anchor="middle">节点 0 · u₀</text><text x="229" y="143" text-anchor="middle">节点 1 · u₁</text><text x="414" y="143" text-anchor="middle">节点 2 · u₂</text></g><path class="assembly-load" d="M419 90H468m-10-6 10 6-10 6"/><text class="assembly-load-label" x="444" y="72" text-anchor="middle">P →</text><text class="assembly-axis" x="239" y="174" text-anchor="middle">x 向右为正 · 每节点只有轴向位移</text></svg>
        <div class="assembly-element-buttons"><button type="button" data-select-element="0" aria-pressed="true">单元 1：节点 0 → 1</button><button type="button" data-select-element="1" aria-pressed="false">单元 2：节点 1 → 2</button></div><p id="assembly-mapping" class="assembly-caption" aria-live="polite"></p>
        <form id="assembly-form" novalidate><div class="assembly-heading"><div><span class="assembly-eyebrow">02 / DEFINE THE MODEL</span><h2>参数与支承</h2></div></div><div class="assembly-inputs">{Object.entries(ASSEMBLY_LIMITS).map(([name, rule])=><label>{rule.label}<div class="assembly-input-unit"><input type="text" inputmode="decimal" name={name} value={ASSEMBLY_DEFAULTS[name]} maxlength="64" autocomplete="off" aria-describedby={`range-${name}`} /><span>{rule.unit}</span></div><small id={`range-${name}`}>{rule.min.toLocaleString('en-US')} 至 {rule.max.toLocaleString('en-US')}</small></label>)}</div><label class="assembly-constraint">支承条件<select name="constraint"><option value="fixed">左端给定位移 u₀ = uc</option><option value="free">无约束：三个节点均自由</option></select></label><p class="assembly-caption">uc 仅在左端给定位移时使用；无约束不会偷偷固定节点。输入范围用于本演示，不是工程设计准则。</p><p id="assembly-validation" class="assembly-validation" role="status"></p><div class="assembly-actions"><button type="submit" id="assembly-solve" class="assembly-button">登录后求解方程</button><button type="button" id="assembly-export" class="assembly-button assembly-button--quiet" disabled>导出本次计算 JSON</button></div></form>
      </div>
      <div class="assembly-matrices"><div class="assembly-heading"><div><span class="assembly-eyebrow">03 / MAP & ADD</span><h2>局部矩阵 → 总体贡献</h2></div><span class="assembly-tag">刚度单位 N/mm</span></div><p class="assembly-caption">点击或用 Tab 聚焦一个局部矩阵项，观察其对应的总体位置。节点号从 0 开始。</p>
        <div class="assembly-matrix-pair"><section><h3 id="assembly-local-title">单元 1 的局部刚度</h3><div id="assembly-local" class="assembly-matrix-scroll"></div></section><section><h3 id="assembly-contribution-title">映射到三节点后的贡献</h3><div id="assembly-contribution" class="assembly-matrix-scroll"></div></section></div>
        <p id="assembly-cell-explanation" class="assembly-cell-note" role="status"></p>
        <section class="assembly-addition"><h3>逐步相加，保留共享节点的贡献</h3><div class="assembly-step-buttons" aria-label="组装步骤"><button type="button" data-assembly-step="0" aria-pressed="false">0 · 空矩阵</button><button type="button" data-assembly-step="1" aria-pressed="true">1 · 加入单元 1</button><button type="button" data-assembly-step="2" aria-pressed="false">2 · 再加入单元 2</button></div><p id="assembly-step-description" class="assembly-caption" aria-live="polite"></p><div id="assembly-global" class="assembly-matrix-scroll"></div><p class="assembly-caption">节点 1 为共享节点，K₁₁ = k₁ + k₂。显示步骤只用于讲解；求解始终采用两单元完整矩阵。</p></section>
        <aside class="assembly-equation"><strong>左端给定位移时，右端项也要改变</strong><p>Kff · uf = Ff − Kfc · uc</p><small>自由节点为 [1, 2]。先从完整 K 分区，再实际消元求解；反力用原始 R = Ku − F 恢复。</small></aside>
      </div>
    </section>
    <p id="assembly-status" class="assembly-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">尚未求解。组装可直接查看，结果不会自动成为个人学习进度。</p>
    <section id="assembly-result" class="assembly-result" aria-labelledby="assembly-result-title" hidden><div class="assembly-heading"><div><span class="assembly-eyebrow">04 / CHECK THE ORIGINAL EQUATIONS</span><h2 id="assembly-result-title">本次浏览器教学计算</h2></div><span class="assembly-tag">计算完成 ≠ 工程验证完成</span></div><p class="assembly-caption">数值由当前页面实际解分区方程得到，未运行 ANSYS、在线 CAE 或用户本机独立复现任务。</p><div class="assembly-results-grid"><div><h3>自由方程与给定位移项</h3><pre id="assembly-partition"></pre></div><div><h3>位移、原方程反力与能量</h3><div id="assembly-result-values"></div></div></div><p class="assembly-caption">应变能 U = ½ Σ kₑ(ub − ua)² = ½ uᵀKu。uc 非零时，单独的 ½ Fᵀu 不等于总应变能；端点恒等式还需计入 ½ R₀uc。</p></section>
    <section class="assembly-scope"><div><span class="assembly-eyebrow">ASSUMPTIONS & LIMITS</span><h2>把演示的边界一起带走。</h2><p>一维轴杆、小应变、线弹性、每段均匀、轴向节点力，不计自重、惯性、温度、接触和弯曲。示意图不按长度或截面比例绘制。</p><p>受压时本程序仍只解轴向线性方程，不检查屈曲或强度。输入范围内也不代表模型适用或工程安全；有限精度残差应按量纲、载荷与尺度解释。</p><p>无约束时 K 的每行之和为零，整体平移不产生应变。载荷不平衡时无静力平衡解；载荷平衡时仍不能得到唯一绝对位移。本程序拒绝返回任意参考位移。</p></div><aside><h3>接着核对一份完整证据</h3><a href="/domains/structural/kp/global-assembly/">总体组装：局部到整体 →</a><a href="/domains/structural/kp/constraint-methods/">约束施加与反力恢复 →</a><a href="/learning/projects/linear-static/">线性静力验证项目 →</a><a href="/diagnostic/rigid-body/">刚体运动与奇异方程 →</a><a href="/failures/review/">记录实际排查与复测 →</a><small>矩阵由本页原创算法组装；公式与推导衔接已有教程及其原始来源。教学内容待本人复核。</small></aside></section>
    <ContentProvenance contentId="lab:assembly" />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
<script src="../../scripts/assembly-lab.ts"></script>
